flowchart TB
  User[Staff browser]
  DNS[DNS]
  subgraph Host[Ubuntu Linux server]
    Proxy[HTTPS reverse proxy<br/>Nginx or Caddy]
    subgraph Docker[Docker network]
      Web[Frontend container<br/>static React build]
      API[NestJS API container]
      DB[(PostgreSQL container<br/>persistent volume)]
    end
    Backup[Encrypted backup target<br/>off-host storage]
    Logs[Application / proxy logs]
  end
  User --> DNS -->|HTTPS 443| Proxy
  Proxy -->|/| Web
  Proxy -->|/api| API
  API --> DB
  DB --> Backup
  Proxy --> Logs
  API --> Logs
